      tags: ["frontier-wave14", "aldosterone", "mineralocorticoid receptor", "NR3C2", "ENaC", "ROMK", "SGK1", "NEDD4-2", "primary aldosteronism", "hypoaldosteronism", "type 4 RTA"]
