      interactions: ["Potassium products, MRAs, potassium-sparing diuretics, trimethoprim, NSAIDs, lithium, diuretics, and other RAAS blockers increase hyperkalemia, renal, pressure, or lithium risk.", "Sacubitril/valsartan already contains valsartan. Adding a separate ARB duplicates AT1 blockade; adding an ACE inhibitor also creates the contraindicated ARNI/ACE combination."],
