      nursingEssentials: ["Expand brand names into ingredients: Entresto contains valsartan; Lotrel contains benazepril; Exforge contains valsartan; Tekturna is aliskiren. This prevents hidden duplicate pathways.", "If duplicate blockade is discovered, assess pressure, orthostasis, creatinine/eGFR, potassium, urine output, hydration, NSAID/diuretic use, pregnancy, and swelling before escalating."],
